  "body": "PR #3402 (merged as 209f62665) adds `pass_start` to 2D Adaptive. The typed MCP patch accepts it (pinned by `mcp_sets_adaptive_pass_start_and_undo_restores_it`), and Trochoidal is refused by name.\n\n`.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md:152` documents `pass_start` for 2D Offset only, and `docs/agents/mcp-tools.md` has no row for the Adaptive case.\n\nWanted: one row in each file: the key, the three values, the refusal for Trochoidal, and the fallback warning (`strategy_fallback`). The change of the skill is a process file change (`Process change: yes`).\n",
